### Full ordered chain (validations & side-effects)
1. Spring Security `@PreAuthorize` role check (`OWNER_ADMIN`) → 403 on failure.
2. `@Valid` Bean Validation on `OwnerFieldsDto` (NotNull/Pattern/Size/Email) → 400 via `handleMethodArgumentNotValidException`.
3. `validateRequiredFields` → 400 `MissingOwnerFieldsException` if any required field blank.
4. `ownerMapper.toOwner(dto)` maps DTO→entity (ignores id, pets).
5. `rejectDuplicateHousehold` (reads all owners) → 409 unless `sharesHousehold=true`.
6. `normalizeTelephone` → 400 `InvalidTelephoneException` if malformed.
7. `rejectDuplicateTelephone` (reads all owners) → 409 on duplicate.
8. Set normalized telephone; set normalized/lowercased email (`normalizeEmail` → 400 on invalid).
9. Default `registrationDate = today` if null.
10. `nextCustomerCode` (reads all owners) → sets `customerCode`.
11. `clinicService.saveOwner` (`@Transactional`) → `ownerRepository.save` → `em.persist` (INSERT); Hibernate re-validates entity-level constraints at flush.
12. `ownerMapper.toOwnerDto` (adds `displayName`, `initials`); set `Location` header; return **201 Created**.
